signal-l5 (1.0.8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Registration: solve the captcha on another device. Signal usually refuses
    captchas solved in the Librem 5's own browser (HTTP 403; hCaptcha scores
    the slow browser as a likely bot), so the captcha step now recommends
    "On another device": the phone shows a QR code and address, serves a
    one-time page on its Wi-Fi address only, and the other device pastes or
    drops the "Open Signal" link there; registration then continues on the
    phone. "On this phone" remains available.
  * Explain a refused captcha (403) and point to the other-device option
    instead of suggesting the same thing again.
  * Recommend python3-qrcode (QR code) and iproute2.

 -- Signal-L5 Maintainers <signal-l5@example.invalid>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:30:00 -0600

